# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep host build output from leaking into the image -
# a stale obj/ from a different RID makes `dotnet restore` inside the container fail in confusing ways.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/node_modules/

# not needed to build the storefront
EvitaDB.Test/
EvitaDB.QueryValidator/
documentation/
data/
*.md
!EvitaDB.Storefront/README.md

.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.DS_Store
